# Week6 Cloud Security

Goal

Secure identities, data, and infrastructure.

Topics to Learn
	•	IAM roles, policies, and least privilege.
	•	Secrets management, encryption, and auditing.
	•	CloudTrail and compliance basics.

Practice Resources

https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/best-practices.html
https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/tutorials_basic.html
https://docs.aws.amazon.com/kms/latest/developerguide/overview.html
https://docs.aws.amazon.com/awscloudtrail/latest/userguide/cloudtrail-create-and-update-a-trail.html
https://owasp.org/www-project-cloud-security/

What Won’t Work

Using admin roles for everything.
If you can’t explain “least privilege,” you’re doing security wrong.
